Description: Ragnar desktop core session
 The complete Ragnar desktop session in one package: session
 manager (ragnar-session), taskbar, desktop icons layer, screen
 lock, polkit agent, keyring, display service, automounter,
 brightness/night-light/OSD/MPRIS helpers, run dialog, power
 dialog, GTK3 theme sync and the labwc compositor bridge.
 Installing ragnar-core yields a working Ragnar session; the
 ragnar-desktop meta package adds the optional applications.

Package: ragnar-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: blueman, ragnar-core (>= 1.0-40), dconf-cli,
 notification-daemon, python3-psutil, xdotool, wdisplays, wlr-randr,
 mesa-utils, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend,
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, ragnar-heimdall, ragnar-skald,
 ragnar-edit, ragnar-taskmanager, ragnar-software, ragnar-settings,
 ragnar-screenshot, ragnar-raven, ragnar-wallpaper,
 ragnar-backgrounds
Description: Ragnar desktop environment (meta package)
 Meta package pulling the complete Ragnar desktop together:
 ragnar-core provides the working session; the Recommends carry
 the optional applications (editor, task manager, settings,
 software centre, network and sound tools, screenshot, reminders,
 wallpaper).

